{"type":"message","id":"1a81e3bd","parentId":"028d5619","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:11:15.488Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公在问\"条件委托\"相关的事，听起来是交易相关的问题——可能是止盈止损挂单、条件单之类的。让我查一下当前持仓和挂单情况。\n\n根据AGENTS.md，这类问题应该用exec工具实际执行查询脚本。我先看看有什么相关的脚本可以查条件委托。\n\n条件委托在币安里就是conditional orders（止盈止损单）。让我跑一下持仓查询和挂单查询。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_fjAt6Do5Em5adjsVCc4e9487","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nfrom binance.client import Client\nimport os, json\n\nclient = Client(os.environ.get('BINANCE_API_KEY',''), os.environ.get('BINANCE_SECRET_KEY',''), testnet=True)\n\n# 查所有持仓\npos = client.futures_position_information()\npositions = [p for p in pos if float(p['positionAmt']) != 0]\nprint('=== 当前持仓 ===')\nfor p in positions:\n    print(f\\\"{p['symbol']}: 数量={p['positionAmt']}, 开仓均价={p['entryPrice']}, 未实现盈亏={p['unRealizedProfit']}\\\")\n\nprint()\n\n# 查所有挂单（条件委托/止盈止损单）\norders = client.futures_get_open_orders()\nprint(f'=== 挂单总数: {len(orders)} ===')\nfor o in orders:\n    print(f\\\"{o['symbol']} | {o['type']} | {o['side']} | 价格={o.get('price','N/A')} | 触发价={o.get('stopPrice','N/A')} | 状态={o['status']} | origQty={o['origQty']}\\\")\n\"\n","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":355,"output":514,"cacheRead":18688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19557,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780621866544}}
