{"type":"message","id":"80c705d2","parentId":"8c534fde","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:12:10.482Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see there are 3 positions: DOT SHORT, LINK SHORT, BTC SHORT. The user is asking about \"条件委托\" (conditional orders / stop orders). Let me check what open orders exist - these would be the conditional/take-profit/stop-loss orders.\n\nLet me write a quick script to check open orders.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_8LJ4qQMIidrRgWplut5w2688","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, os\nwith open('auto_trade_config.json') as f:\n    cfg = json.load(f)\n\nfrom binance.um_futures import UMFutures\nclient = UMFutures(key=cfg['api_key'], secret=cfg['api_secret'], base_url='https://testnet.binancefuture.com')\n\norders = client.get_orders()\nopen_orders = [o for o in orders if o['status'] != 'FILLED' and o['status'] != 'CANCELED']\nprint(f'总挂单: {len(open_orders)}')\nfor o in open_orders:\n    print(json.dumps(o, indent=2, default=str))\n    print('---')\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v \"InsecureRequest\\|urllib3\\|warnings\"","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":397,"output":390,"cacheRead":20864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21651,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780621923414}}
