{"type":"message","id":"973c09f7","parentId":"d2e6f472","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:13:12.249Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, now I have the algo orders. Let me also get the full list to see everything. Let me rerun the same but with no truncation, and format it nicely.\n\nThe user might be asking about \"这么多条件委托\" - many conditional orders. From the raw output, I can see at least BNBUSDT has a STOP_MARKET at 614.16 and TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET at 578.04. Let me get the full list.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_2yXBI6Q42GzpTnbouE060196","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\nimport json\n\n# 查所有 algo 条件委托\nresult = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders')\nif isinstance(result, str):\n    result = json.loads(result)\n\nprint(f'条件委托总数: {len(result)} 单\\n')\nby_sym = {}\nfor r in result:\n    sym = r.get('symbol','')\n    by_sym.setdefault(sym, []).append(r)\n\nfor sym, orders in by_sym.items():\n    print(f'--- {sym} ({len(orders)}单) ---')\n    for o in orders:\n        t = o.get('orderType','')  # STOP_MARKET / TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\n        s = o.get('side','')\n        trigger = o.get('triggerPrice','')\n        qty = o.get('quantity','')\n        status = o.get('algoStatus','')\n        reduce = o.get('reduceOnly', False)\n        wt = o.get('workingType','')\n        print(f'  {t:22s} {s:5s} 触发价={trigger:>12s} 数量={qty:>8s} 状态={status:6s} reduce={reduce} 价格类型={wt}')\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v \"InsecureRequest\\|urllib3\\|warnings\"","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":513,"output":573,"cacheRead":25088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26174,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780621983324}}
