- DELETE /fapi/v1/algoOpenOrders - cancels all algo orders for a specific symbol\n\nLet me look at cancel_all_orders in the code to understand what it's doing.\n\nHmm, actually the manual_trade.py cancel command takes a symbol. Let me just use it to cancel BNB and DOT orders, then manually place correct DOT orders.\n\nBut first let me look at how the DOT orders should be set up. The position is:\n- DOT SHORT: -195.3 @ $1.024, current price $1.024\n\nFor a SHORT position:\n- TP should be a BUY at a LOWER price: e.g., 1.024 * 0.98 = ~1.004 or based on strategy\n- SL should be a BUY at a HIGHER price: e.g., 1.024 * 1.03 = ~1.055 or based on strategy\n\nLet me look at the strategy rules in SOUL.md:\n- 止盈 = min(阻力位, 价格×(1+ATR×1.5×RSI因子), 24h高点)\n- 止损 = max(支撑位×0.995, 价格×(1-ATR×分层倍数), 24h低点×0.98)\n- 保底: 止盈≥+3%, 止损≤-3%, 盈亏比≥1.5:1\n- 三档移动止盈\n\nThis is complex. Let me just place reasonable TP/SL based on standard rules. Let me look at what the strategy code computes.\n\nBut first, let me clean up the bad orders and investigate the bugs. Let me do this in parallel:\n\n1. Cancel BNB and DOT algo orders\n2. Check the code for bugs\n3. Check if signal monitor is running and using score/AI\n\nLet me start.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好，我来一步步处理。先清理异常委托，同时查代码。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_z3ItMoPhX9oJ31S8ySAX4201","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 manual_trade.py cancel BNB 2>&1 | grep -v \"InsecureRequest\\|urllib3\\|warnings\"","timeout":10}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_Si3DFWuPr4BwfMQHiyE01886","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 manual_trade.py cancel DOT 2>&1 | grep -v \"InsecureRequest\\|urllib3\\|warnings\"","timeout":10}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_02_ACClc8pfbF0AwizHnYmH6993","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && grep -n \"def place_algo_conditional_order\\|def place_order\\|tp_price\\|sl_price\