{"type":"message","id":"e7ae2e11","parentId":"13cbe163","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:17:11.814Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_02_ACClc8pfbF0AwizHnYmH6993","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"366:def place_algo_conditional_order(\n377:    order_type: STOP_MARKET（止损）| TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET（止盈）\n383:        \"algoType\": \"CONDITIONAL\",\n414:def place_order(symbol, side, quantity, leverage=10, tp_price=None, sl_price=None, price=0, reduce_only=False):\n423:        tp_price: 止盈价格 (可选)\n424:        sl_price: 止损价格 (可选)\n434:    formatted_tp = format_price(tp_price) if tp_price else None\n435:    formatted_sl = format_price(sl_price) if sl_price else None\n468:            symbol, sl_side, \"STOP_MARKET\", formatted_sl\n480:            symbol, tp_side, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\", formatted_tp\n521:        \"tp_price\": formatted_tp,\n522:        \"sl_price\": formatted_sl,\n527:def log_order_info(symbol, side, quantity, price, tp_price, sl_price, reduce_only=False):\n535:        if tp_price:\n536:            log_msg += f\", 止盈=${tp_price:.6f}\"\n537:        if sl_price:\n538:            log_msg += f\", 止损=${sl_price:.6f}\""}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":111,"aggregated":"366:def place_algo_conditional_order(\n377:    order_type: STOP_MARKET（止损）| TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET（止盈）\n383:        \"algoType\": \"CONDITIONAL\",\n414:def place_order(symbol, side, quantity, leverage=10, tp_price=None, sl_price=None, price=0, reduce_only=False):\n423:        tp_price: 止盈价格 (可选)\n424:        sl_price: 止损价格 (可选)\n434:    formatted_tp = format_price(tp_price) if tp_price else None\n435:    formatted_sl = format_price(sl_price) if sl_price else None\n468:            symbol, sl_side, \"STOP_MARKET\", formatted_sl\n480:            symbol, tp_side, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\", formatted_tp\n521:        \"tp_price\": formatted_tp,\n522:        \"sl_price\": formatted_sl,\n527:def log_order_info(symbol, side, quantity, price, tp_price, sl_price, reduce_only=False):\n535:        if tp_price:\n536:            log_msg += f\", 止盈=${tp_price:.6f}\"\n537:        if sl_price:\n538:            log_msg += f\", 止损=${sl_price:.6f}\"","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780622231804}}
{"type":"message","id":"29b638f0","parentId":"e7ae2e11","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:17:15.532Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, both BNB and DOT orders cancelled. Now let me look at the place_order function in detail to understand how it places TP/SL for SHORT positions, and see if there's a bug.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"BNB和DOT的异常单已清掉。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_Q6F1ylqAL45DTNYCNvIc5636","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py","offset":414,"limit":80}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_1F3babPUK5hVp37YpB9j5471","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py","offset":355,"limit":50}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":537,"output":263,"cacheRead":29184,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29984,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780622231819}}
{"type":"message","id":"b2f98cd0","parentId":"29b638f0","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:17:15.678Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_Q6F1ylqAL45DTNYCNvIc5636","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def place_order(symbol, side, quantity, leverage=10, tp_price=None, sl_price=None, price=0, reduce_only=False):\n    \"\"\"\n    下单\n    \n    Args:\n        symbol: 币种符号 (如 BTCUSDT)\n        side: BUY/SELL\n        quantity: 数量\n        leverage: 杠杆倍数 (默认 10x)\n        tp_price: 止盈价格 (可选)\n        sl_price: 止损价格 (可选)\n        price: 当前价格（用于计算精度）\n        reduce_only: 是否只减仓（平仓时用，不受最低金额限制）\n    \"\"\"\n    # 2026-03-28 老公指示：开仓前先设置逐仓模式\n    if not reduce_only:\n        set_isolated_margin(symbol)\n    \n    # 格式化数量和价格（根据 Binance 精度要求）\n    formatted_quantity = format_quantity(symbol.replace(\"USDT\", \"\"), quantity, price) if price > 0 else quantity\n    formatted_tp = format_price(tp_price) if tp_price else None\n    formatted_sl = format_price(sl_price) if sl_price else None\n    \n    log_order_info(symbol, side, formatted_quantity, price, formatted_tp, formatted_sl, reduce_only)\n    \n    # 1. 设置杠杆（reduce_only 时跳过）\n    if not reduce_only:\n        leverage_result = request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/leverage\", {\n            \"symbol\": symbol,\n            \"leverage\": leverage\n        })\n    else:\n        leverage_result = {\"skipped\": True}\n    \n    # 2. 下单\n    order_params = {\n        \"symbol\": symbol,\n        \"side\": side,\n        \"type\": \"MARKET\",\n        \"quantity\": formatted_quantity,\n        \"reduceOnly\": str(reduce_only).lower()\n    }\n    \n    order_result = request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/order\", order_params)\n    \n    # 主单失败时直接返回，不要再下 SL/TP（避免无主单的孤儿挂单）\n    main_order_ok = isinstance(order_result, dict) and bool(order_result.get(\"orderId\"))\n    if not main_order_ok:\n        log.error(f\"🔴 {symbol} 主单失败，跳过 SL/TP 提交。原始响应：{order_result}\")\n    \n    # 3. 设置止盈止损（Algo Order API，避免 -4120）\n    if main_order_ok and formatted_sl:\n        sl_side = \"SELL\" if side == \"BUY\" else \"BUY\"\n        sl_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n            symbol, sl_side, \"STOP_MARKET\", formatted_sl\n        )\n        if isinstance(sl_result, dict) and sl_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(\n                f\"📌 {symbol} 止损 Algo 单已提交：{formatted_sl} algoId={sl_result.get('algoId')}\"\n            )\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 止损单提交失败：{sl_result}\")\n\n    if main_order_ok and formatted_tp:\n        tp_side = \"SELL\" if side == \"BUY\" else \"BUY\"\n        tp_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n            symbol, tp_side, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\", formatted_tp\n        )\n        if isinstance(tp_result, dict) and tp_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(\n                f\"📌 {symbol} 止盈 Algo 单已提交：{formatted_tp} algoId={tp_result.get('algoId')}\"\n            )\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 止盈单提交失败：{tp_result}\")\n    \n    # 检查订单是否成功（严格判断：必须有 orderId）\n    # 🐛 2026-04-27 修复：原 `\"code\" in str(order_result)` 判断在某些 Binance 字段\n    #     里可能误判（如未来新增字段名含 code），改为「正向判断有 orderId」\n    order_success = False\n    order_msg = \"\"\n\n[98 more lines in file. Use offset=494 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780622235664}}
{"type":"message","id":"ae4076b7","parentId":"b2f98cd0","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:17:15.698Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_1F3babPUK5hVp37YpB9j5471","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                qty = abs(amt)\n                place_order(symbol, side, qty)\n                log.info(f\"✅ 爆仓保护平仓 {symbol} {side} {qty}\")\n        except Exception as e:\n            log.error(f\"❌ 爆仓保护平仓失败 {symbol}: {e}\")\n\ndef cancel_algo_orders(symbol: str):\n    \"\"\"取消某币种全部 Algo 条件单（TP/SL）\"\"\"\n    return request(\"DELETE\", \"/fapi/v1/algoOpenOrders\", {\"symbol\": symbol})\n\n\ndef place_algo_conditional_order(\n    symbol: str,\n    side: str,\n    order_type: str,\n    trigger_price,\n    working_type: str = \"MARK_PRICE\",\n    quantity: float = None,\n):\n    \"\"\"\n    币安 USD-M 条件单（2025-12 起须走 Algo API，否则 -4120）\n\n    order_type: STOP_MARKET（止损）| TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET（止盈）\n    side: 平仓方向 — 平多 SELL，平空 BUY\n    quantity: 精确数量（传了就用 reduceOnly+quantity，不传保留旧行为 closePosition=true）\n    2026-06-04 修复：closePosition=true 在测试网算出错误数量，改为传入精确 quantity\n    \"\"\"\n    params = {\n        \"algoType\": \"CONDITIONAL\",\n        \"symbol\": symbol,\n        \"side\": side,\n        \"type\": order_type,\n        \"triggerPrice\": format_price(trigger_price),\n        \"workingType\": working_type,\n    }\n    if quantity is not None:\n        sym = symbol.replace(\"USDT\", \"\")\n        params[\"quantity\"] = str(format_quantity(sym, quantity, 0))\n        params[\"reduceOnly\"] = \"true\"\n    else:\n        params[\"closePosition\"] = \"true\"\n    return request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/algoOrder\", params)\n\n\ndef check_margin_ratio_protection():\n    \"\"\"\n    爆仓保护检查\n    保证金率低于 5% 立即平仓所有持仓\n    \"\"\"\n    margin_ratio = get_margin_ratio()\n\n[187 more lines in file. Use offset=405 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780622235685}}
{"type":"message","id":"93c441f6","parentId":"ae4076b7","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:17:31.438Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the key things:\n\n1. `place_algo_conditional_order` - the side logic is: \"平多 SELL，平空 BUY\". This is correct for reducing positions.\n\n2. In `place_order` (line 464-470), when placing SL/TP:\n   - `sl_side = \"SELL\" if side == \"BUY\" else \"BUY\"` - so if main order is BUY (LONG), SL is SELL; if main is SELL (SHORT), SL is BUY. This is correct.\n\n3. The bug from 2026-06-04 fix mentions: `closePosition=true` 在测试网算出错误数量，改为传入精确 quantity.\n\nBut the DOT orders had a SELL (wrong direction) TP order and two qty=0 orders. This suggests the `place_algo_conditional_order` was called with wrong parameters somewhere, or there's another code path that placed those orders.\n\nLet me check the crypto_signal_monitor.py - this is the main trading script that places orders. Let me look for how it calls place_order and place_algo_conditional_order.\n\nAlso let me check if the DOT orders that were qty=0 might have been caused by the old `closePosition=true` behavior before the 2026-06-04 fix.\n\nActually, looking at the DOT orders again:\n- TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET SELL @ 1.110 - SELL direction is wrong for SHORT position (should be BUY)\n- STOP_MARKET BUY @ 1.040, qty=0 - correct direction but qty=0\n- TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET BUY @ 0.983, qty=0 - correct direction but qty=0\n\nThe SELL direction one is really weird. Let me check if there's another code path placing these. Let me also check the crypto_signal_monitor.py.\n\nBut before that, let me also look at the place_algo_conditional_order a bit more carefully. The comment says:\n\"side: 平仓方向 — 平多 SELL，平空 BUY\"\n\nAnd in the code at line 383:\n```python\nparams[\"closePosition\"] = \"true\"  # old behavior\n```\n\nWait, the code I read says `closePosition` not `closePosition=true`. Let me re-read... Actually: `params[\"closePosition\"] = \"true\"` - yes `closePosition`.\n\nBut the 2026-06-04 fix says it was changed to use quantity instead. But there's still the else branch with closePosition=true. So maybe the old orders were created before this fix was applied?\n\nNow let me check the signal monitor code and also check if there's a bug in how TP/SL are placed when the main order isn't matched correctly.\n\nLet me also look at the order placement logic in crypto_signal_monitor.py.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_297jU8kJJZTBJaiQzIpL0106","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"place_order\\|place_algo_conditional\\|cancel_algo_orders\\|def.*signal\\|def.*strategy\\|def.*score\\|def.*ai\\|def.*predict\\|def.*open_position\\|math\\|trending\\|ranging\\|volatile\\|atr\" ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py | head -50","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1539,"output":1371,"cacheRead":29824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32734,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780622235702}}
