{"type":"message","id":"7c2d641b","parentId":"a54a44a1","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:21:07.282Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Ah, I see the issue now! The `cancel_all_orders` function calls `DELETE /fapi/v1/allOpenOrders`, which is for **regular** open orders (limit orders), NOT for algo orders (conditional TP/SL orders). There are two separate endpoints:\n\n- `DELETE /fapi/v1/allOpenOrders` - cancels all regular open orders (limit/market orders)\n- `DELETE /fapi/v1/algoOrder` - cancels a specific algo order by algoId (conditional TP/SL orders)\n\nAnd the manual_trade.py's `cmd_cancel` calls `bat.cancel_all_orders()`, which only cancels regular limit orders, not algo orders. That's why the cancel appeared to succeed but the algo orders remained!\n\nSo the bug is:\n1. `cancel_all_orders` only cancels regular orders, not algo/conditional orders\n2. To cancel algo orders, you need to list them first with `GET /fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders`, then cancel each individually with `DELETE /fapi/v1/algoOrder`\n\nThe existing `cancel_algo_orders` function also uses `DELETE /fapi/v1/algoOpenOrders` which doesn't exist or doesn't work on Binance Testnet.\n\nNow for the config, let me check the symbols list.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了！`cancel_all_orders` 删的是普通挂单（`/fapi/v1/allOpenOrders`），不是条件委托（algo orders）。所以之前跑 cancel 时提示成功但条件单纹丝不动。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_G7IfwFvDmXJ0ZJTEpIaj8087","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('auto_trade_config.json') as f:\n    cfg = json.load(f)\nprint('symbols:', cfg.get('symbols'))\nprint('max_positions:', cfg.get('max_positions'))\nprint('total_capital:', cfg.get('total_capital'))\nprint('score_threshold:', json.dumps(cfg.get('score_threshold',{}), indent=2))\nprint('atr_sl_tiers:', cfg.get('atr_sl_tiers'))\n\"","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":151,"output":778,"cacheRead":54272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55201,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780622457548}}
