{"type":"message","id":"8de57236","parentId":"ef1a217e","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:21:17.205Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_AL6VPViOhVcmdR5fsPGW2097","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"CONFIG = {\n    # 交易标的\n    \"symbols\": [\"BTC\", \"ETH\", \"SOL\", \"BNB\", \"DOT\", \"LINK\", \"XRP\"],  # 2026-03-30 老公指示：加回 XRP\n\n    # 资金管理\n    \"total_capital\": 100,          # USDT（模拟盘）\n    \"position_size_pct\": 0.20,     # 单仓 20% - 2026-03-28 老公指示\n    \"max_positions\": 4,\n\n    # 开仓阈值（按市场状态分层）\n    \"score_threshold\": {\n        \"trending\":  70,\n        \"ranging\":   55,  # 震荡市要求更高确认度，避免假突破\n        \"volatile\":  90,\n        # 单币阈值加成：等于提高开仓门槛\n        \"per_symbol_bonus\": {\n            \"SOL\": 10,           # SOL 历史胜率低，多要10分\n        },\n    },\n\n    # 基础止盈止损（ATR动态覆盖）\n    \"base_tp_pct\":  0.08,\n    \"base_sl_pct\":  0.05,\n\n    # 移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：关闭移动止盈，严格固定 -2% 止损\n    # 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（回撤比例）\n    \"trailing_tiers\": [\n        {\"pnl\": 0.02, \"gap\": 0.008},  # 2% 时，回撤 0.8% → 锁定 1.2%（2.4U @20U）\n        {\"pnl\": 0.03, \"gap\": 0.01},   # 3% 时，回撤 1% → 锁定 2%（4U @20U）⭐️ 老公指示\n        {\"pnl\": 0.04, \"gap\": 0.999},  # 4% 时，全平 → 锁定 4%（8U @20U）\n    ],\n\n    # ATR止损倍数分层\n    \"atr_sl_tiers\": [\n        (0.02, 1.0),   # ATR% < 2%  →  止损1.0倍ATR\n        (0.04, 1.5),   # ATR% < 4%  →  止损1.5倍ATR\n        (9999, 2.0),   # ATR% >= 4% →  止损2.0倍ATR\n    ],\n\n    # 熔断\n    \"circuit_breaker_pct\": -0.10,   # 日亏损超10%触发\n    \"circuit_breaker_hours\": 4,     # 暂停4小时\n\n    # 信号冷却\n    \"signal_cooldown\": {\n        \"same_direction\": 300,    # 同向5分钟\n        \"opposite\":       0,      # 反向立即\n        # 单币冷却覆盖（秒），SOL 高频低胜率，拉长冷却\n        \"per_symbol\": {\n            \"SOL\": 600,           # 10分钟\n        },\n    },\n\n    # 新闻过滤\n    \"news_blacklist\": [\n\n[2575 more lines in file. Use offset=114 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780622477146}}
{"type":"message","id":"f2125ddc","parentId":"8de57236","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:21:45.153Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a complete picture. Let me finalize the analysis.\n\nThe BNB is in the symbols list. So BNB is actively traded by the system. But there's no BNB position now. The BNB algo orders were likely from a previous BNB position that was closed, but the SL/TP orders were never cancelled.\n\nNow let me also verify that LINK has a STOP order. Earlier I saw only LINK TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET in the last query. Let me check if the STOP was missing.\n\nActually, wait - at 09:12 I saw both LINK orders. At 09:20, I only saw the TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET (algoId=1000000096371017). But in between, I didn't touch any LINK orders. Let me check...\n\nActually, looking at my output from 09:19 (the second algo query):\n```\nLINKUSDT   TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET     BUY   触发价=       7.730 数量=   24.84 状态=NEW\n```\n\nOnly one LINK order. But at 09:12:\n```\nLINKUSDT (2单):\n  STOP_MARKET            BUY   触发价=       7.950 数量=   24.84 状态=NEW\n  TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET     BUY   触发价=       7.730 数量=   24.84 状态=NEW\n```\n\nSo LINK lost its STOP order between 09:12 and 09:19! That means the monitor is running and did something that caused the stop to be canceled but not replaced.\n\nWait, actually, looking at the `sync_stop_loss_to_binance` function - it first cancels the STOP_MARKET, then places a new one. If the monitor is running and it did a sync for LINK, it would cancel the stop and place a new one. But what if the new stop placement failed? Then the stop would be missing.\n\nOr maybe the monitor hasn't yet processed the LINK sync in this cycle and just canceled the old stop. This is a potential race condition.\n\nBut this is getting quite deep. Let me present the key findings to the user now.\n\nSummary for the user:\n1. ✅ BNB orphan orders cleaned\n2. ✅ DOT broken orders cleaned  \n3. ✅ DOT correct TP/SL placed\n4. Root bugs found:\n   a) `cancel_all_orders` function in binance_auto_trade.py uses `/fapi/v1/allOpenOrders` which is for regular limit orders only, NOT for algo/conditional orders. That's why `manual_trade.py cancel` didn't clean the algo orders.\n   b) There's no working \"cancel all algo orders for a symbol\" function. Need to list+delete individually.\n   c) Old `closePosition=true` caused qty=0 orders on testnet (fixed on 2026-06-04 but old orders remained).\n   d) When position direction reverses, old algo orders aren't guaranteed to be cleaned up.\n   e) LINK lost its STOP order (only TAKE_PROFIT remains) - likely a race condition in sync_stop_loss_to_binance.\n\n5. The trading system IS using all three decision layers:\n   - ✅ 分数计算 (calc_score): technical scoring\n   - ✅ 数学分析 (indicators, regime detection, calc_tp_sl)\n   - ✅ AI预测 (AIPredictor.predict via DeepSeek)\n\nLet me present this clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好了，全部汇总一下。\n\n---\n\n**✅ 清理完成，当前条件委托状态：**\n\n| 币种 | 止损 | 止盈 |\n|---|---|---|\n| BTC SHORT | STOP @ 64464 ✅ | TP @ 60672 ✅ |\n| DOT SHORT | SL @ 1.040 ✅ (新) | TP @ 0.983 ✅ (新) |\n| LINK SHORT | ❌ 缺了！ | TP @ 7.730 ✅ |\n\n已删掉 BNB 孤儿单 2 个、DOT 数量为 0 的废单 2 个、DOT 方向错误 SELL 单 1 个。\n\n⚠️ LINK 的止损单不见了 — 只剩止盈单，可能是同步止损时崩了。\n\n---\n\n**🔍 代码 Bug 分析：**\n\n**1. `cancel_all_orders` 删不到条件委托（核心 bug）**\n\n`binance_auto_trade.py:548` 里删的是普通挂单（`/fapi/v1/allOpenOrders`），不是 algo 条件单。条件单要走 `GET openAlgoOrders` → `DELETE /algoOrder?algoId=xxx`。所以 `manual_trade.py cancel` 会提示成功但条件单纹丝不动。\n\n**2. 旧 `closePosition=true` 遗留废单**\n\n6 月 4 号之前用的是 `closePosition=true` 代替传精确数量，测试网算出来 qty=0。DOT 那两单数量为 0 的就是这样产生的，虽然代码修了但旧单没清理。\n\n**3. 仓位转向时旧单没清干净**\n\nDOT 那个 SELL 止盈单说明之前 DOT 可能是 LONG，后来转向 SHORT 时旧止盈单没 100% 删掉。`_cancel_algo_by_type` 只按类型删，但网络异常/API 报错时可能静默失败。\n\n**4. LINK 止损消失**\n\n只有止盈没有止损，很可能是 `sync_stop_loss_to_binance` 先删了旧止损、新止损提交失败后没恢复。\n\n---\n\n**📊 策略确认：正在用分数 + 数学 + AI 吗？**\n\n**是的，三层都在跑：**\n\n- **分数计算** (`calc_score`) — 价格突破 40 分 + 成交量 30 分 + ATR 20 分 + BTC 大盘 10 分 → 和阈值对比决定方向\n- **数学分析** — market regime 检测（trending/ranging/volatile）、ATR 动态止损、三档移动止盈、风控熔断\n- **AI 预测** (`AIPredictor.predict`) — 信号达标 / 重大新闻 / 浮亏>2% 时调 DeepSeek，AI 和数学信号冲突时高信心反向就观望\n\n---\n\nLINK 的止损要补上吗？还有 `cancel_all_orders` 这个 bug 你想修一下不？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":796,"output":2123,"cacheRead":56320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59239,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780622477224}}
