{"type":"message","id":"55102da7","parentId":"f4062fd2","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:23:12.961Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also fix the `_cancel_algo_by_type` function in crypto_signal_monitor.py to be more robust. The current implementation only cancels by orderType, which means if the type is wrong (e.g., the order type became something unexpected during a position reversal), it won't get cleaned up.\n\nActually, the more important fix is to make the algo order cleanup more robust in situations where position direction changes. But `_cancel_algo_by_type` is designed to be precise (cancel only stops, keep TP, or vice versa), so changing its logic might break things.\n\nThe real issue is that when a position reverses direction (LONG → SHORT), the old algo orders should be completely wiped clean before new ones are placed. Let me look at where `submit_initial_algo_orders` is called.\n\nIn the `submit_initial_algo_orders` function, it already calls `_cancel_algo_by_type` for both STOP_MARKET and TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET separately. This should work if the cancel succeeds. But if the cancel silently fails (API error, network issue), old orders remain.\n\nA better approach would be to add a \"force cancel all\" before resubmitting. Let me improve `submit_initial_algo_orders` to cancel ALL algo orders for the symbol first, then resubmit both.\n\nActually, looking at `submit_initial_algo_orders` again:\n```python\n# 只取消止损单，不动止盈\n_cancel_algo_by_type(sym_usdt, \"STOP_MARKET\")\n# 提交止损\nsl_result = place_algo_conditional_order(...)\n# 只取消止盈单，不动止损  \n_cancel_algo_by_type(sym_usdt, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\")\n# 提交止盈\ntp_result = place_algo_conditional_order(...)\n```\n\nThe approach is fine for normal updates. But the issue is when direction changes. The existing SELL TP from a previous LONG wouldn't match TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET as the type-check in `_cancel_algo_by_type` only checks `orderType == order_type`, which would match TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET regardless of side. So it should cancel a SELL TP too.\n\nUnless... the old order had a different type name, or the cancel quietly failed. Let me make the cleanup more robust by adding logging and retry.\n\nActually, I think the most robust fix is in the `submit_initial_algo_orders` function to do a full cancel of all algo orders for the symbol (not just by type), then resubmit both. And in the position rebuild flow, use `cancel_algo_orders` (the fixed version) to do a full cleanup first.\n\nLet me update `submit_initial_algo_orders`:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now fix the algo order cleanup in the signal monitor — make `submit_initial_algo_orders` do full cleanup when it's a fresh sync (direction reversal):"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_R4HIA4eNgoJnNZjDyWmD8356","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":10,"offset":720,"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":104,"output":1312,"cacheRead":61312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":62728,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780622578300}}
{"type":"message","id":"eb0ae4fa","parentId":"55102da7","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:23:13.073Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_R4HIA4eNgoJnNZjDyWmD8356","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def _cancel_algo_by_type(symbol_usdt: str, order_type: str):\n    \"\"\"取消某币种指定类型的 Algo 单（不影响另一边）\"\"\"\n    try:\n        result = request(\"GET\", \"/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders\", {\"symbol\": symbol_usdt})\n        if isinstance(result, list):\n            for o in result:\n                if o.get('orderType') == order_type and o.get('algoStatus') == 'NEW':\n                    algo_id = o.get('algoId')\n                    if algo_id:\n                        request(\"DELETE\", \"/fapi/v1/algoOrder\", {\"algoId\": algo_id})\n\n[1959 more lines in file. Use offset=730 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780622593050}}
{"type":"message","id":"bd67b51f","parentId":"eb0ae4fa","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:23:17.995Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me look at how `submit_initial_algo_orders` is called and add a full-cleanup option.\n\nThe function already does partial cleanup by type, but the issue is that when a position direction reverses, there can be orders with the wrong direction (SELL vs BUY) that the type-based filter doesn't catch.\n\nLet me modify the function to first do a full cancel of all algo orders (using the fixed `cancel_algo_orders`), then resubmit both TP and SL. This is cleaner and more robust.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_isYxPqWg0zAtJSSzqPOI1190","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":55,"offset":770,"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":218,"output":315,"cacheRead":62080,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":62613,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780622593095}}
{"type":"message","id":"c4c6fa14","parentId":"bd67b51f","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:23:18.137Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_isYxPqWg0zAtJSSzqPOI1190","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    为从 API 同步/方向反转后的持仓提交初始止盈止损 Algo 单。\n    2026-06-03 修复：精准替换，不碰另一边\n    2026-06-04 修复：传入精确 quantity 代替 closePosition=true（测试网算错数量）\n    \"\"\"\n    if not AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED:\n        return\n    try:\n        sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n        typ = pos[\"type\"]\n        sl_price = pos.get(\"sl_price\")\n        tp_price = pos.get(\"tp1_price\")\n        if not sl_price or not tp_price:\n            return\n        \n        qty = abs(pos.get(\"amount\", 0))\n        sym_usdt = f\"{sym}USDT\"\n        # 只取消止损单，不动止盈\n        _cancel_algo_by_type(sym_usdt, \"STOP_MARKET\")\n\n        # 提交止损\n        sl_side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n        sl_result = place_algo_conditional_order(sym_usdt, sl_side, \"STOP_MARKET\", sl_price, quantity=qty)\n        if isinstance(sl_result, dict) and sl_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(f\"📌 {sym} 止损 Algo 单已提交：{sl_price} algoId={sl_result.get('algoId')}\")\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {sym} 止损 Algo 单提交失败：{sl_result}\")\n\n        # 只取消止盈单，不动止损\n        _cancel_algo_by_type(sym_usdt, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\")\n        tp_side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n        tp_result = place_algo_conditional_order(sym_usdt, tp_side, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\", tp_price, quantity=qty)\n        if isinstance(tp_result, dict) and tp_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(f\"📌 {sym} 止盈 Algo 单已提交：{tp_price} algoId={tp_result.get('algoId')}\")\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {sym} 止盈 Algo 单提交失败：{tp_result}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        log.warning(f\"⚠️ {sym} 提交初始 Algo 单异常：{e}\")\n\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n# 八、熔断器\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nclass CircuitBreaker:\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.daily_pnl   = 0.0\n        self.reset_date  = datetime.now().date()\n        self.paused_until: Optional[datetime] = None\n\n    def record_trade(self, pnl: float):\n        today = datetime.now().date()\n        if today != self.reset_date:\n            self.daily_pnl = 0.0\n            self.reset_date = today\n            self.consecutive_losses = 0  # 每日重置连亏计数\n        self.daily_pnl += pnl\n\n[1864 more lines in file. Use offset=825 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780622598120}}
{"type":"message","id":"b6eb1715","parentId":"c4c6fa14","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:23:35.883Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'll update `submit_initial_algo_orders` to do a full clean slate approach - cancel ALL algo orders for the symbol first (using the fixed `cancel_algo_orders`), then submit both TP and SL. Also update the sync_stop_loss_to_binance to be more robust.\n\nLet me rewrite the function to:\n1. Cancel ALL algo orders for the symbol (clean slate)\n2. Submit SL\n3. Submit TP","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_uWMwVALiJ1PmDXrJ94wx3961","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","old_string":"def submit_initial_algo_orders(pos: dict):\n    \"\"\"\n    为从 API 同步/方向反转后的持仓提交初始止盈止损 Algo 单。\n    2026-06-03 修复：精准替换，不碰另一边\n    2026-06-04 修复：传入精确 quantity 代替 closePosition=true（测试网算错数量）\n    \"\"\"\n    if not AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED:\n        return\n    try:\n        sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n        typ = pos[\"type\"]\n        sl_price = pos.get(\"sl_price\")\n        tp_price = pos.get(\"tp1_price\")\n        if not sl_price or not tp_price:\n            return\n        \n        qty = abs(pos.get(\"amount\", 0))\n        sym_usdt = f\"{sym}USDT\"\n        # 只取消止损单，不动止盈\n        _cancel_algo_by_type(sym_usdt, \"STOP_MARKET\")\n\n        # 提交止损\n        sl_side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n        sl_result = place_algo_conditional_order(sym_usdt, sl_side, \"STOP_MARKET\", sl_price, quantity=qty)\n        if isinstance(sl_result, dict) and sl_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(f\"📌 {sym} 止损 Algo 单已提交：{sl_price} algoId={sl_result.get('algoId')}\")\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {sym} 止损 Algo 单提交失败：{sl_result}\")\n\n        # 只取消止盈单，不动止损\n        _cancel_algo_by_type(sym_usdt, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\")\n        tp_side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n        tp_result = place_algo_conditional_order(sym_usdt, tp_side, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\", tp_price, quantity=qty)\n        if isinstance(tp_result, dict) and tp_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(f\"📌 {sym} 止盈 Algo 单已提交：{tp_price} algoId={tp_result.get('algoId')}\")\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {sym} 止盈 Algo 单提交失败：{tp_result}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        log.warning(f\"⚠️ {sym} 提交初始 Algo 单异常：{e}\")","new_string":"def submit_initial_algo_orders(pos: dict):\n    \"\"\"\n    为从 API 同步/方向反转后的持仓提交初始止盈止损 Algo 单。\n\n    2026-06-05 修复：方向反转 / 初始同步场景先全量清理该币种所有 Algo 单，\n    再重新提交正确的 TP+SL。防止旧方向的条件单残留（如 LONG 的 SELL TP\n    在反转成 SHORT 后没删干净）。\n    \"\"\"\n    if not AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED:\n        return\n    sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n    try:\n        typ = pos[\"type\"]\n        sl_price = pos.get(\"sl_price\")\n        tp_price = pos.get(\"tp1_price\")\n        if not sl_price or not tp_price:\n            return\n        \n        qty = abs(pos.get(\"amount\", 0))\n        sym_usdt = f\"{sym}USDT\"\n\n        # 🔧 2026-06-05 修复：全量清理，不留任何旧单\n        cancel_algo_orders(sym_usdt)\n\n        # 提交止损\n        sl_side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n        sl_result = place_algo_conditional_order(sym_usdt, sl_side, \"STOP_MARKET\", sl_price, quantity=qty)\n        if isinstance(sl_result, dict) and sl_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(f\"📌 {sym} 止损 Algo 单已提交：{sl_price} algoId={sl_result.get('algoId')}\")\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {sym} 止损 Algo 单提交失败：{sl_result}\")\n\n        # 提交止盈\n        tp_side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n        tp_result = place_algo_conditional_order(sym_usdt, tp_side, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\", tp_price, quantity=qty)\n        if isinstance(tp_result, dict) and tp_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(f\"📌 {sym} 止盈 Algo 单已提交：{tp_price} algoId={tp_result.get('algoId')}\")\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {sym} 止盈 Algo 单提交失败：{tp_result}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        log.warning(f\"⚠️ {sym} 提交初始 Algo 单异常：{e}\")"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":769,"output":1362,"cacheRead":62464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":64595,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780622598157}}
