{"type":"message","id":"7b798ec3","parentId":"420bd4b4","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:24:08.143Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_DqXKAPpZJGaOow6hUpbT1178","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n        try:\n            # ──────────────────────────────────\n            # Step 1: 获取实时价格（0 REST请求）\n            # ──────────────────────────────────\n            prices = {sym: price_stream.get(sym) for sym in CONFIG[\"symbols\"]}\n\n            # ──────────────────────────────────\n            # Step 2: 止盈止损检查（每15秒，最轻量）\n            # ──────────────────────────────────\n            exits = check_exits_fast(positions, prices)\n            for pos, reason, size in exits:\n                p = prices[pos[\"symbol\"]][\"price\"]\n                pnl = close_position(pos, reason, size, p)\n                circuit_breaker.record_trade(pnl)\n\n                # 🐛 2026-06-03 修复：平仓后验证 API 才删除本地持仓，防止平仓失败时被 API 同步救回循环\n                if reason == \"TP1\":\n                    positions.remove(pos)\n                    save_positions(positions)\n                    log.info(f\"TP1 触发 {pos['symbol']}，全平移除\")\n                elif reason == \"SL\":\n                    # 先同步 API 确认仓位真的没了再删\n                    sym_closed = pos['symbol']\n                    positions.remove(pos)\n                    save_positions(positions)\n                    log.info(f\"SL 触发 {sym_closed}，止损移除\")\n                    try:\n                        api_positions = get_all_positions()\n                        api_still_there = any(\n                            float(p.get('amount', 0)) != 0 and p.get('symbol', '') == sym_closed\n                            for p in (api_positions or [])\n                        )\n                        if api_still_there:\n                            log.error(f\"⛔ SL 平仓 {sym_closed} 未成交！Binance 仓位仍在，恢复本地缓存\")\n                            # 从 API 重建该币种持仓\n                            for ap in api_positions:\n                                amt = float(ap.get('amount', 0))\n                                if amt != 0 and ap.get('symbol', '') == sym_closed:\n                                    entry = float(ap.get('entry_price', 0))\n                                    typ = 'SHORT' if amt < 0 else 'LONG'\n                                    old = pos\n                                    positions.append({\n                                        'symbol': sym_closed,\n                                        'type': typ,\n                                        'entry_price': entry,\n                                        'amount': abs(amt),\n                                        'tp1_price': old.get('tp1_price', 0),\n                                        'sl_price': old.get('sl_price', 0),\n                                        'tp1_hit': old.get('tp1_hit', False),\n                                        'size_remaining': old.get('size_remaining', 1.0),\n                                    })\n                                    save_positions(positions)\n                                    log.warning(f\"🔄 已恢复本地持仓 {sym_closed}（Binance 上仓位未被平掉）\")\n                                    break\n                        else:\n                            api_count = sum(1 for p in api_positions if float(p.get('amount', 0)) != 0)\n                            if api_count == 0:\n                                positions = []\n                                save_positions(positions)\n                                log.info(\"📊 SL 平仓后同步：API 持仓为 0，清空本地缓存\")\n                            else:\n                                log.info(f\"📊 SL 平仓后同步：API 还有{api_count}个持仓，保留本地缓存\")\n                    except Exception as e:\n                        log.error(f\"⚠️ SL 平仓后同步失败：{e}\")\n\n\n            # 移动止盈更新\n            update_trailing_stop(positions, prices)\n            save_positions(positions)\n\n\n            # ──────────────────────────────────\n            # Step 3: 指标计算（60秒一次）\n            # ──────────────────────────────────\n            if scheduler.should(\"indicators\"):\n                for sym in CONFIG[\"symbols\"]:\n                    ind = indicator_engine.calc(sym)\n                    if ind:\n                        indicators[sym] = ind\n\n[211 more lines in file. Use offset=2480 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780622648123}}
{"type":"message","id":"50406159","parentId":"7b798ec3","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:24:17.782Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I notice that when positions are closed via TP1 or SL, there's no code to cancel the remaining algo orders. After closing a position:\n- If TP1 hits, the SL order for that symbol is still active on Binance\n- If SL hits, the TP order for that symbol is still active on Binance\n\nThese orphan algo orders would persist. This could explain why BNB had orphan orders - BNB position was closed but the TP/SL were never cancelled.\n\nHowever, looking more carefully:\n- TP1 is \"全平\" (close 100%), so after TP1 hits, the position is gone. Both TP and SL should be cancelled.\n- If SL hits, the TP should also be cancelled.\n\nI should add algo order cleanup after position close. Let me add this.\n\nBut wait, this is also handled by the position sync/reconciliation logic. When the API shows 0 positions, the positions list is cleared, and on the next iteration, the position sync would detect the change. But it wouldn't clean up algo orders in that case.\n\nActually, the position sync at the beginning of the main loop handles this: if api_count == 0 and len(positions) > 0, it clears positions but doesn't cancel algo orders. And if the position was closed externally (e.g., by the TP/SL algo), there might be no cleanup at all.\n\nLet me add algo order cleanup after position close. I'll add a call to `cancel_algo_orders` when a position is removed.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"平仓后也需要清理条件单，不然会产生孤儿单（BNB 就是这样）。加上："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_3LOeSXbuMJT0Yob4kU7w4424","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":30,"offset":2410,"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":962,"output":735,"cacheRead":66304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68001,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRea