{"type":"message","id":"84cc4e24","parentId":"db4ff8ca","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:35:56.209Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the situation now:\n\n1 position: BTC SHORT\n5 algo orders:\n- BTC: STOP + TP ✅ (both present)\n- LINK: TP + STOP ✅ (both present) — but no LINK position!\n- DOT: only TP — no STOP! And no DOT position either!\n\nWait, where did the DOT STOP go? It was there before (algoId=1000000096371233). It seems the monitor restarted (kj) and:\n\n1. LINK and DOT positions were closed (both gone)\n2. But LINK's algo orders (both TP + STOP) weren't cleaned up\n3. DOT's TP order wasn't cleaned up, and DOT's STOP order (which I manually placed) is missing - maybe it was cancelled but the TP remained\n4. BTC's algo orders got new algoIds (1000000096381496 and 1000000096381550) — the monitor recreated them when restarting\n\nSo the issue is:\n- LINK has no position but 2 orphan algo orders\n- DOT has no position but 1 orphan algo order (TP)\n- BTC is fine\n\nWait, the monitor restarted (kj) and now LINK/DOT positions are gone. That means they were either:\n1. Closed by TP/SL during the restart process\n2. The position sync detected they were gone from the exchange\n\nEither way, the algo order cleanup I added should have worked... but wait, I said the user needs to kj restart to apply my changes. If they did kj and the monitor ran the OLD code (before my changes), the old code wouldn't clean up algo orders on close.\n\nAlso, looking at DOT: the STOP order is gone but the TP remains. This is the same pattern as before - LINK only had TP when we first looked. The monitor's `sync_stop_loss_to_binance` or similar function likely deleted the STOP but failed to replace it, then the position was closed, leaving the TP as an orphan.\n\nSo the core issue is clear: the old code running on restart is causing these problems. My fixes need to be applied.\n\nLet me just clean up the orphans now (LINK TP+STOP, DOT TP) and let the user know they need to kj restart for the fixes to take effect.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"只有 BTC 1 个仓，LINK 和 DOT 已平仓但条件单全留下了。刚才加的清理代码还没生效（需要 kj 重启）。先把孤儿单清掉："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_QNnageEiRjT3lJacRA2O9279","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\n# LINK 全部、DOT 全部（已无持仓）\nfor aid in [1000000096371017, 1000000096371248, 1000000096373482]:\n    r = bat.request('DELETE', '/fapi/v1/algoOrder', {'algoId': aid})\n    print(f'删 algoId={aid}: {r.get(\\\"code\\\", \\\"?\\\")} {r.get(\\\"msg\\\", \\\"\\\")}')\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v \"InsecureRequest\\|urllib3\\|warnings\"","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":432,"output":1188,"cacheRead":71680,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73300,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780623339287}}
