{"type":"message","id":"2493a7a9","parentId":"c2c80fc6","timestamp":"2026-06-05T06:12:17.148Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also clean up the current bad orders (qty=0 ones) and add missing TP for DOT.\n\nCurrent broken orders:\n- LINK STOP @ 8.040 qty=0 → delete, re-create with correct qty\n- LINK TP @ 7.570 qty=0 → delete, re-create with correct qty\n- DOT STOP @ 1.040 qty=0 → delete, re-create with correct qty + missing TP\n- BNB STOP @ 622.81 qty=0 → delete, re-create with correct qty\n- BNB TP @ 573.66 qty=0 → delete, re-create with correct qty\n\nThis is going to be a lot of individual operations. Let me write a script that:\n1. Lists all open algo orders\n2. Deletes all qty=0 orders\n3. Re-creates correct orders based on actual positions\n\nFor the re-creation:\n- DOT SHORT -195.7 @ 1.022: TP = 1.022*0.96 = 0.981, SL = 1.022*1.02 = 1.0424\n- BNB SHORT -0.33 @ 597.18: TP = 597.18*0.96 = 573.29, SL = 597.18*1.02 = 609.12\n- LINK SHORT -25.38 @ 7.878: TP = 7.878*0.96 = 7.563, SL = 7.878*1.02 = 8.036\n\nLet me do it all at once.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在删废单 + 补正确的："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_F6cRwuJUiN3eOq88gBTr3410","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\n# 1. 清理所有 qty=0 的条件单\nresult = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders')\nfor r in result:\n    if float(r.get('quantity', 0)) == 0:\n        aid = r['algoId']\n        bat.request('DELETE', '/fapi/v1/algoOrder', {'algoId': aid})\n        print('删 qty=0: algoId=%s %s %s' % (aid, r['symbol'], r['orderType']))\n\n# 2. 为 LINK / DOT / BNB 重下正确条件单\n# LINK SHORT -25.38 @ 7.878: TP=7.878*0.96=7.563 SL=7.878*1.02=8.036\n# DOT SHORT -195.7 @ 1.022: TP=1.022*0.96=0.981 SL=1.022*1.02=1.042\n# BNB SHORT -0.33 @ 597.18: TP=597.18*0.96=573.29 SL=597.18*1.02=609.12\n\norders = [\n    ('LINKUSDT', 'BUY', 'STOP_MARKET', 8.036, 25.38),\n    ('LINKUSDT', 'BUY', 'TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET', 7.563, 25.38),\n    ('DOTUSDT', 'BUY', 'STOP_MARKET', 1.042, 195.7),\n    ('DOTUSDT', 'BUY', 'TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET', 0.981, 195.7),\n    ('BNBUSDT', 'BUY', 'STOP_MARKET', 609.12, 0.33),\n    ('BNBUSDT', 'BUY', 'TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET', 573.29, 0.33),\n]\nfor sym, side, otype, trig, qty in orders:\n    r = bat.place_algo_conditional_order(sym, side, otype, trig, quantity=qty)\n    ok = 'ok' if r.get('algoId') else 'FAIL'\n    print('%s %s %s trig=%.3f qty=%.2f → %s' % (ok, sym, otype, trig, qty, r.get('algoId','')))\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v \"InsecureRequest\\|urllib3\\|warnings\"","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":128,"output":1348,"cacheRead":78592,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80068,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780639920625}}
