{"type":"message","id":"e6348e07","parentId":"3c7a3139","timestamp":"2026-06-05T06:15:01.949Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the results are mixed:\n\n1. **Delete phase**: 5 qty=0 orders were successfully deleted\n2. **Place phase**: ALL 6 orders FAILED with Binance backend timeout (`-1007: Timeout waiting for response from backend server`)\n\nThe deletes went through but the creates failed. The Binance testnet backend is timing out when placing new algo orders. This is a Binance issue, not a code issue.\n\nSo now the state is:\n- BTC: STOP + TP ✅ (unchanged, qty=0.003)\n- LINK: No orders (both deleted, both placement failed)\n- DOT: No orders (STOP deleted, both placement failed)\n- BNB: No orders (both deleted, both placement failed)\n\nThis means LINK, DOT, and BNB have no TP/SL protection at all. And it's currently fighting with 0 UR.\n\nLet me check current state and retry.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Binance 测试网后端超时了 —— 5个废单已删但 6 单都提交失败。让我重试："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_yZX90C2HFbIN2dJOn1qs3336","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && timeout 45 python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\n# 先确认当前状态\nresult = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders')\nprint('当前: %d 单' % len(result))\nfor r in result:\n    print('  %s %s qty=%s' % (r['symbol'], r['orderType'], r['quantity']))\n\n# 逐个补，加延迟\norders = [\n    ('LINKUSDT', 'BUY', 'STOP_MARKET', 8.036, 25.38),\n    ('LINKUSDT', 'BUY', 'TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET', 7.563, 25.38),\n    ('DOTUSDT', 'BUY', 'STOP_MARKET', 1.042, 195.7),\n    ('DOTUSDT', 'BUY', 'TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET', 0.981, 195.7),\n    ('BNBUSDT', 'BUY', 'STOP_MARKET', 609.12, 0.33),\n    ('BNBUSDT', 'BUY', 'TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET', 573.29, 0.33),\n]\nimport time\nfor sym, side, otype, trig, qty in orders:\n    time.sleep(2)\n    r = bat.place_algo_conditional_order(sym, side, otype, trig, quantity=qty)\n    if r.get('algoId'):\n        print('OK %s %s trig=%.3f qty=%s' % (sym, otype, trig, r.get('quantity','')))\n    else:\n        code = r.get('code', '?')\n        msg = r.get('msg', str(r)[:100])\n        print('FAIL %s %s: code=%s msg=%s' % (sym, otype, code, msg))\nPYEOF\n","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1832,"output":918,"cacheRead":83072,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":85822,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780640088563}}
