{"type":"message","id":"c8f9bbc6","parentId":"9241e5e2","timestamp":"2026-06-05T06:17:07.329Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking two things:\n1. Does the system have trailing stop (移动止盈)?\n2. Does every position have its TP/SL orders?\n\nLet me check:\n1. The current state of trailing stop in the code and config\n2. Current positions and orders\n\nI should look at the code and the actual state on Binance.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_1VT6fETW0sjVYAIvCBPn8233","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && timeout 20 python3 -c \"\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\npos = bat.get_all_positions()\nprint('=== 持仓 %d ===' % len(pos))\nfor p in pos:\n    print('  %s %s amt=%s 入场=%s 浮盈=%s' % (p['symbol'], p['type'], p['amount'], p['entry_price'], p.get('unrealized_pnl','?')))\nresult = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders')\nprint()\nprint('=== 条件委托 %d ===' % len(result))\nfor r in result:\n    print('  %s %s trig=%s qty=%s' % (r['symbol'], r['orderType'], r['triggerPrice'], r['quantity']))\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v \"urllib3\\|warnings\"","timeout":25}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_XfVjsbh2wRcVNOZz3ZKy4563","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"trailing_tiers\\|移动止盈\\|update_trailing\\|trailing.*stop\\|trailing.*enabled\\|TRAILING\" ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py | head -10","timeout":3}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":7852,"output":502,"cacheRead":79744,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88098,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780640219044}}
