{"type":"message","id":"c4997de4","parentId":"dfc9593d","timestamp":"2026-06-05T06:17:27.121Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the situation:\n\n1. **Positions**: 4 (DOT, BNB, LINK, BTC) - all SHORT, all in profit\n2. **Orders**: 7 total\n   - BTC: STOP + TP ✅ (correct qty)\n   - LINK: STOP + TP ❌ (qty=0)\n   - DOT: only STOP ❌ (qty=0, missing TP)\n   - BNB: STOP + TP ❌ (qty=0)\n\n3. **Trailing stop**: Enabled with 3-tier system. The `update_trailing_stop` is called in the main loop.\n\nThe trailing stop logic is:\n- Tier 1: 2% profit → lock 0.8% → stops @ 1.2%\n- Tier 2: 3% profit → lock 1% → stops @ 2%  \n- Tier 3: 4% profit → full close\n\nSo YES, trailing stops are active. But the current orders are broken:\n- LINK/DOT/BNB have qty=0 orders (useless)\n- DOT is missing TP entirely\n\nThe user hasn't done kj restart yet (old code still running with the place_order bug). The monitor is creating qty=0 orders via the broken closePosition=true path.\n\nLet me present the answer clearly: trailing is enabled, but 3 out of 4 positions have broken (qty=0) orders, which means no actual TP/SL protection. Need kj restart to apply the fix.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**移动止盈：有，在跑** ✅\n\n三档追踪，从峰值价回撤：\n\n| 档位 | 利润 | 锁定 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 第1档 | +2% | 回撤0.8%→保1.2% |\n| 第2档 | +3% | 回撤1%→保2% |\n| 第3档 | +4% | 全平 |\n\n**条件委托：3/4有问题** ❌\n\n```\nBTC  ✅ STOP 64464 / TP 60672  (正常)\nLINK ❌ STOP+T   qty=0         (废单，无效保护)\nDOT  ❌ 只有STOP  qty=0         (缺TP，STOP无效)\nBNB  ❌ STOP+T   qty=0         (废单，无效保护)\n```\n\n还是同一个问题 —— `kj` 还没重启，旧代码的 `place_order` 没传 quantity，每次开仓/重建都把条件单搞成 qty=0。BTC 那两单是正常的因为一直没被动过。\n\n`kj` 一下让 `place_order` 的修复生效，monitor 启动后会自动把这三仓的条件单重建为正确的。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":667,"output":904,"cacheRead":87936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89507,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReaso