{"type":"message","id":"eb0ff49c","parentId":"87bcaacf","timestamp":"2026-06-05T06:32:12.131Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_5ilqnXO0P2m5wKogyz2h8801","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def format_price(price):\n    \"\"\"格式化价格到正确的精度\"\"\"\n    if price >= 1000:\n        return round(price, 2)\n    elif price >= 100:\n        return round(price, 2)\n    elif price >= 10:\n        return round(price, 2)\n    elif price >= 1:\n        return round(price, 2)\n    elif price >= 0.1:\n        return round(price, 4)\n    elif price >= 0.01:\n        return round(price, 5)\n    else:\n        return round(price, 6)\n\ndef set_isolated_margin(symbol):\n    \"\"\"\n    设置逐仓模式 (ISOLATED)\n\n[326 more lines in file. Use offset=300 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780641132117}}
{"type":"message","id":"d300c5d3","parentId":"eb0ff49c","timestamp":"2026-06-05T06:32:41.118Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so `format_price` rounds based on price magnitude:\n- >= 10: 2 decimals\n- >= 1: 2 decimals  \n- >= 0.1: 4 decimals\n- >= 0.01: 5 decimals\n- < 0.01: 6 decimals\n\nFor DOT trigger prices like 0.983 (SL) and 0.925 (TP, but format_price(0.925) returns round(0.925, 5) = 0.925 → but when cast to str via f-string it becomes \"0.925\". Wait, format_price returns round(0.925, 5) which is 0.925. Then in place_algo_conditional_order, `triggerPrice: format_price(trigger_price)` happens. In the f-string `f\"{k}={v}\"`, it would be \"triggerPrice=0.925\".\n\nHmm wait, but calc_tp_sl returns `round(tp1, 4)` for DOT. So:\n- TP = 0.964 * 0.96 = 0.92544 → round(0.92544, 4) = 0.9254\n- SL = 0.964 * 1.02 = 0.98328 → round(0.98328, 4) = 0.9833\n\nThen format_price(0.9254) → 0.1 <= 0.9254 < 1 → round(0.9254, 2) = 0.93! Wait, that changes the price!\n\nOh no. The format_price function rounds DOT prices to 2 decimals. But calc_tp_sl rounds to 4. So format_price(round(0.964*0.96, 4)) = format_price(0.9254) → round(0.9254, 2) = 0.93. But the triggerPrice needs to be 0.925 for DOT.\n\nHmm wait, this works for higher-priced coins but for sub-$1 coins like DOT, the 2-decimal rounding distorts the trigger price.\n\nActually wait, looking at the `format_price` function again: \n```\nprice >= 1 → round(price, 2)\n```\n\nFor 0.9254, price < 1, so it falls to:\n```\nprice >= 0.1 → round(price, 4)\n```\n0.9254 >= 0.1 → round(0.9254, 4) = 0.9254. When converted to string: \"0.9254\".\n\nBut Binance DOTUSDT price tickSize is 0.001 (3 decimals). So \"0.9254\" with 4 decimals would still exceed the 3-decimal limit!\n\nSo the issue is that `round(price, 4)` gives 4 decimal places, but DOTUSDT only allows 3 decimal places for prices.\n\nThe fix: add a `get_price_precision` function with per-symbol precision. For DOT, use 3 decimals for prices. Or better yet, use `round(price, 3)` in the 0.1-1 range.\n\nActually, let me think about which coins could be in the 0.1-1 range:\n- DOT: $0.1-1 range, price precision 0.001 (3 decimals)\n- XRP: $1-3 range, price precision 0.0001 (4 decimals) → but >= 1 so 2 decimals? That's wrong too.\n\nThis approach of using price magnitude to determine precision is fundamentally flawed. Different coins have different tick sizes regardless of price. I need per-symbol price precision.\n\nLet me add a `get_price_precision` function and use it in `place_algo_conditional_order`.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"DOT 价格位 $0.9 触发位 `format_price` 的错误区间，精度不匹配。加按币种区分价格精度："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_MLUd2QTgQ3izAR76mpzT7978","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py","old_string":"def get_quantity_precision(symbol, price):\n    \"\"\"\n    根据 Binance API 的 stepSize 动态获取数量精度\n    来源：/fapi/v1/exchangeInfo LOT_SIZE.stepSize\n    \"\"\"\n    # 币种精度映射（仅保留当前交易的币种）\n    # 更新：2026-03-28 老公指示：添加 BTC\n    precision_map = {\n        'BTC': 3,      # stepSize: 0.001\n        'ETH': 3,      # stepSize: 0.001\n        'SOL': 2,      # stepSize: 0.01\n        'BNB': 2,      # stepSize: 0.01 ✅ 2026-03-28 修复：3→2 位\n        'DOT': 1,      # stepSize: 0.1\n        'LINK': 2,     # stepSize: 0.01\n        'XRP': 1,      # stepSize: 0.1 ✅ 2026-03-31 同步：加回 XRP\n    }\n    \n    return precision_map.get(symbol.upper(), 8)  # 默认 8 位","new_string":"def get_quantity_precision(symbol, price):\n    \"\"\"\n    根据 Binance API 的 stepSize 动态获取数量精度\n    来源：/fapi/v1/exchangeInfo LOT_SIZE.stepSize\n    \"\"\"\n    # 币种精度映射（仅保留当前交易的币种）\n    # 更新：2026-03-28 老公指示：添加 BTC\n    precision_map = {\n        'BTC': 3,      # stepSize: 0.001\n        'ETH': 3,      # stepSize: 0.001\n        'SOL': 2,      # stepSize: 0.01\n        'BNB': 2,      # stepSize: 0.01 ✅ 2026-03-28 修复：3→2 位\n        'DOT': 1,      # stepSize: 0.1\n        'LINK'