{"type":"message","id":"0b5eae9a","parentId":"0e67fe48","timestamp":"2026-06-05T06:42:31.900Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the code fixes DID take effect. Looking at the latest run (14:39):\n\n1. The DOT precision error is fixed — now DOT shows `-1007` timeout instead of `-1111` precision error\n2. The cancel now doesn't appear (or appears as info instead of warning) — because `cancel_algo_orders` with the fix properly deleted old orders, and when they're already gone (-2011), it logs as info\n3. BUT the Binance testnet backend is consistently timing out (`-1007`) for ALL algo order creations (DOT, BNB, BTC)\n\nThis is a Binance infrastructure issue — the Algo Order creation endpoint on testnet is not responding. Every single creation attempt across ALL coins is timing out.\n\nThe code fixes are correct. The issue is purely Binance's backend being down for algo order creation.\n\nLet me tell the user this is a Binance problem, not a code problem. The fixes are working (precision errors gone, cancel working), but Binance testnet algo order API is refusing new orders.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"代码修复生效了 👑 看日志：\n\n- ✅ DOT 精度修复 — `-1111` 没了，换成和其他币一样的 `-1007`\n- ✅ 取消逻辑修复 — 不再报 `-2011` warning\n- ❌ 但 Binance 测试网的 **Algo 订单创建接口全线超时**\n\n所有币种（DOT/BNB/BTC）全部 `-1007 后端超时`，不是我们的问题。GET 查单和 DELETE 删单都正常，只有 POST 新建条件单挂了。\n\n等 Binance 测试网恢复就行，monitor 已经在循环重试了，恢复后会自动补上。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":868,"output":590,"cacheRead":103808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":105266,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780641740517}}
