{"type":"message","id":"658d8550","parentId":"2f16a4b3","timestamp":"2026-06-05T06:44:11.491Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"今天修了 7 个 bug，记下来了："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ET_zQs8duKgyQFUNTHYmSwE6466","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-05.md","content":"# 2026-06-05 日志\n\n## 条件委托系统大修（7 个 bug）\n\n告警：4仓 9单条件委托 → 3仓废单 qty=0 + BNB孤儿单 + DOT方向错误。\n\n### 修复清单\n\n#### binance_auto_trade.py (5项)\n1. **`cancel_algo_orders` 假删修复** — 旧 `DELETE /algoOpenOrders` 不生效，改为 GET列表→逐笔 DELETE\n2. **`cancel_all_orders` 同时清条件单** — 原来只删 /allOpenOrders(普通单)，条件单残留\n3. **`place_order` 传 quantity** — 开仓时调 algo 单没传 quantity，走 closePosition=true → 测试网 qty=0\n4. **`place_algo_conditional_order` 触发价精度** — 加 `get_price_precision()` 按币种格式化，修复 DOT -1111\n5. **cancel -2011 降级** — 已不存在的单不算 error，改 log.info\n\n#### crypto_signal_monitor.py (2项)\n6. **`submit_initial_algo_orders` 全清后重建** — 方向反转时先 cancel_algo_orders() 全部删清，再建新单\n7. **平仓后清理条件单** — TP1/SL 触发平仓后调 cancel_algo_orders()，防止 BNB 式孤儿单\n\n### 当前状态\n- Binance 测试网 Algo POST 接口全线 -1007 超时，GET/DELETE 正常\n- 代码修复已验证生效（DOT 精度从 -1111 → -1007，取消逻辑干净）\n- 等 Binance 恢复后 monitor 自动重建条件单\n\n### 当前持仓\nBTC SHORT / DOT SHORT / BNB SHORT（3仓，LINK 已平）\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":177,"output":509,"cacheRead":105472,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106158,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780641839894}}
