{"type":"message","id":"784af9de","parentId":"2580c228","timestamp":"2026-06-05T06:44:19.109Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, memory saved. Let me give the user the summary now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"存好了 ✅\n\n**今天修的 7 个 bug：**\n\n| # | 文件 | 问题 | 修法 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `binance_auto_trade.py` | `cancel_algo_orders` 删不掉条件单 | GET 列 → 逐笔 DELETE |\n| 2 | `binance_auto_trade.py` | `cancel_all_orders` 只清普通单 | 同时清条件单 |\n| 3 | `binance_auto_trade.py` | `place_order` 开仓不传 quantity | 传 `formatted_quantity` |\n| 4 | `binance_auto_trade.py` | DOT 触发价精度 `-1111` | 加 `get_price_precision()` 按币种格式化 |\n| 5 | `binance_auto_trade.py` | -2011 报 warning 刷日志 | 降级 info |\n| 6 | `crypto_signal_monitor.py` | 方向反转旧单残留 | `submit_initial_algo_orders` 先全清再建 |\n| 7 | `crypto_signal_monitor.py` | 平仓后条件单变孤儿 | TP1/SL 触发后 `cancel_algo_orders` |"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":594,"output":304,"cacheRead":105600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106498,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780641851607}}
