{"type":"message","id":"f95e3ed8","parentId":"0ec363b4","timestamp":"2026-06-05T07:02:56.705Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"New LINK LONG position opened (13.34 @ 7.498), but no TP/SL orders were created for it. The old LINK orphan orders (qty=0 STOP 8.040 and TP 7.570) are still there, and they're showing as still existing now.\n\nThe user tried to cancel them manually but got \"server busy\". Let me try to cancel them via API.\n\nAlso:\n- DOT still has 1 STOP qty=0, no TP\n- BNB still has STOP+TP qty=0\n- BTC has good orders\n\nThe LINK old orders have algoIds: 1000000096413480 and 1000000096413499. The monitor's cancel_algo_orders should handle these. But looking at the log, the monitor might not be running the cancel for LINK because LINK has a position now (the old LINK SHORT was closed, but now there's a new LINK LONG - different direction).\n\nWait, actually the monitor might be trying to sync and create orders for the new LINK LONG. Let me try to manually cancel the old LINK orphan orders first, and also clean up.\n\nActually, let me just try to cancel the orphan LINK orders via API. The user already tried from the UI.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"LINK 新单开了但两单旧委托卡着。试试 API 删："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_uKBIZVmeawyC2rJ9XflA6462","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && timeout 20 python3 -c \"\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\nimport sys\n\n# 先取消 LINK 旧单\nalgo_ids = [1000000096413480, 1000000096413499]\nfor aid in algo_ids:\n    r = bat.request('DELETE', '/fapi/v1/algoOrder', {'algoId': aid})\n    print('删 algoId=%s: %s' % (aid, r.get('code', r.get('msg','?')) if isinstance(r,dict) else r))\n\n# 再确认\nresult = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders')\nlinks = [r for r in result if 'LINK' in r['symbol']]\nprint()\nprint('LINK 剩余 %d 单:' % len(links))\nfor r in links:\n    print('  %s %s qty=%s' % (r['orderType'], r['triggerPrice'], r['quantity']))\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v \"urllib3\\|warnings\"","timeout":25}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":483,"output":833,"cacheRead":55424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56740,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780642961875}}
