{"type":"message","id":"cc585799","parentId":"ed666a71","timestamp":"2026-06-05T11:18:53.293Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Found it! There's a circuit breaker issue:\n\n1. The circuit breaker was triggered at 08:55 with -10.9% daily loss, pausing for 4 hours\n2. But it should have expired at ~12:55\n3. Yet at 19:00, no positions are being opened even though scores exist\n\nLet me check the latest circuit breaker status. Also let me check if there are more recent circuit breaker messages (after 09:00).\n\nWait, looking at the 18:00 scores: all 30 with NONE signal.\nLooking at 19:00 scores: mostly 10-30 with NONE signal.\n\nThe scores are all 10-30 which is below the Ranging threshold of ≥30. \n\nBut wait, DOT/LINK/SOL/XRP all have 30 points. In a ranging market, ≥30 should trigger. But the signal says NONE.\n\nLet me check the actual score criteria more carefully:\n- 10-30 score means only MA60 is contributing (20 points for being below MA60, minus any RSI penalty)\n- Wait, the RSI is now 54-69 range, none are extreme enough to trigger full RSI points\n\nActually, looking at the scoring from SOUL.md:\n- RSI (35分) - <35 做多 +35, >65 做空 +35\n- 24h涨跌 (25分) - 跌>5% 做多 +25, 涨>5% 做空 +25\n- MA60 (20分) - 价格≥MA60 做多 +20, ≤MA60 做空 +20\n- 成交量 (20分) - >20周期平均 +20\n\nSo for RSI: only 35 points when extreme (<35 or >65). \nBTC RSI 54: 0 points\nBTC 24h -1.3%: 0 points (not >5%)\nBTC MA60 below: 20 points for short\nBTC Volume: probably 0\n\nTotal: 0 + 0 + 20 + 0 = 20, but showing 10. Maybe volume penalty? or partial RSI?\n\nWait, it shows 10 for BTC. Let me think more:\n- RSI 54: between 35 and 65, neither long nor short trigger → 0\n- 24h -1.3%: less than 5% → 0\n- MA60 below: bearish → +20 for SHORT\n- Volume: unknown, could be -10\n\nTotal: 0 + 0 + 20 + (volume?) = 10, so volume = -10? That seems wrong.\n\nActually maybe the RSI gives partial score when near threshold? Like RSI 54 is 11 away from 65 (short threshold), so it gets some score? Let me re-read the scoring rules.\n\nFrom SOUL.md: \"RSI (35分) - <35 做多 +35, >65 做空 +35\" - this seems binary. Either full 35 or 0.\n\nHmm, but 10 points doesn't make sense with 0+0+20 = 10 unless there's a -10 volume penalty.\n\nActually, let me not speculate. The key finding is the circuit breaker. It was triggered at 08:55 with -10.9% daily loss. That's a 4-hour pause. It should have expired at 12:55, well before now.\n\nLet me check if the circuit breaker got stuck. Also let me check the circuit breaker status explicitly by reading the state file or checking for recent breaker messages.\n\nActually, there's a gap between the breaker at 09:00 and now. After 09:00 there were no more breaker messages. But also, positions were opened after that: DOT at 10:40, BNB at 11:35, DOT again at 14:22, LINK at 15:25. So the breaker did expire and trading resumed.\n\nSo the breaker is NOT the issue. The issue is simply that scores are too low (10-30 points), and no signal triggers because the current scores don't meet the threshold.\n\nBut wait - DOT/LINK/SOL/XRP have 30 points. The threshold is ≥30 for ranging. These should trigger!\n\nLet me look more carefully. Maybe the issue is that the MA60 line is below price (as shown by the ✗ mark), but the ✗ might mean \"below\" which is short signal. So all coins get +20 short points from MA60. And maybe some get 0 from RSI and 0 from 24h change.\n\nIf scores are 30 and threshold is ≥30, they should trigger! Unless there's another check somewhere.\n\nLet me check the exact signal generation code to understand why 30-point scores show NONE. Maybe there's a minimum score of >30 (not ≥30) or there's an additional check.\n\nActually, maybe the score of 30 is just from volume + MA60, and without RSI confirmation the signal is suppressed. Let me check the monitor code for signal generation logic.\n\nLet me look at the monitor log more carefully around the scoring times to see if the monitor is actually checking for signals at all, or if the signal check is being bypassed.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"分数注意到了，但熔断器呢："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_k6WSdLcR3UhX0QijlVM77548","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -E \"熔断|暂停|circuit|resume|恢复交易\" /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log | tail -5","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":828,"output":2322,"cacheRead":73344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":76494,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780658307608}}
