{"type":"message","id":"5c9c4b43","parentId":"4ef42005","timestamp":"2026-06-05T11:19:06.204Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me look at the score threshold configuration and the signal generation logic.\n\nLine 2581: `if not is_full and score >= CONFIG[\"score_threshold\"][regime]`\n\nThe threshold for the regime. But also line 561-566 shows that for each symbol:\n- threshold = score_threshold[regime] + per_symbol_bonus\n- if long_score > short_score and long_score >= threshold → LONG\n- if short_score > long_score and short_score >= threshold → SHORT\n\nAnd score_threshold is at line 69. Let me read the config.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_APM5xi5xRvHM4q4UkrHc5572","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":30,"offset":64,"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_uGrzTukrKR2Wp2JewEkS6522","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":35,"offset":550,"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":217,"output":412,"cacheRead":75776,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":76405,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780658339934}}
{"type":"message","id":"305faa71","parentId":"5c9c4b43","timestamp":"2026-06-05T11:19:06.291Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_APM5xi5xRvHM4q4UkrHc5572","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    \"total_capital\": 100,          # USDT（模拟盘）\n    \"position_size_pct\": 0.20,     # 单仓 20% - 2026-03-28 老公指示\n    \"max_positions\": 4,\n\n    # 开仓阈值（按市场状态分层）\n    \"score_threshold\": {\n        \"trending\":  70,\n        \"ranging\":   55,  # 震荡市要求更高确认度，避免假突破\n        \"volatile\":  90,\n        # 单币阈值加成：等于提高开仓门槛\n        \"per_symbol_bonus\": {\n            \"SOL\": 10,           # SOL 历史胜率低，多要10分\n        },\n    },\n\n    # 基础止盈止损（ATR动态覆盖）\n    \"base_tp_pct\":  0.08,\n    \"base_sl_pct\":  0.05,\n\n    # 移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：关闭移动止盈，严格固定 -2% 止损\n    # 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（回撤比例）\n    \"trailing_tiers\": [\n        {\"pnl\": 0.02, \"gap\": 0.008},  # 2% 时，回撤 0.8% → 锁定 1.2%（2.4U @20U）\n        {\"pnl\": 0.03, \"gap\": 0.01},   # 3% 时，回撤 1% → 锁定 2%（4U @20U）⭐️ 老公指示\n        {\"pnl\": 0.04, \"gap\": 0.999},  # 4% 时，全平 → 锁定 4%（8U @20U）\n    ],\n\n    # ATR止损倍数分层\n    \"atr_sl_tiers\": [\n        (0.02, 1.0),   # ATR% < 2%  →  止损1.0倍ATR\n\n[2607 more lines in file. Use offset=94 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780658346278}}
{"type":"message","id":"5927d9b3","parentId":"305faa71","timestamp":"2026-06-05T11:19:06.310Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_uGrzTukrKR2Wp2JewEkS6522","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"        btc_bull = _btc.get(\"ema20_15m\", 0) > _btc.get(\"ema60_15m\", 0)\n        if btc_bull:\n            long_score  += 10\n            short_score -= 5\n        else:\n            short_score += 10\n            long_score  -= 5\n\n    long_score  = max(0, long_score)\n    short_score = max(0, short_score)\n\n    threshold = CONFIG[\"score_threshold\"][regime]\n    # 单币阈值加成：低胜率币种提高门槛\n    threshold += CONFIG[\"score_threshold\"].get(\"per_symbol_bonus\", {}).get(symbol, 0)\n    if long_score > short_score and long_score >= threshold:\n        return long_score, \"LONG\"\n    elif short_score > long_score and short_score >= threshold:\n        return short_score, \"SHORT\"\n\n    return max(long_score, short_score), \"NONE\"\n\n\ndef calc_tp_sl(\n    entry: float,\n    direction: str,\n    ind: dict,\n    price_data: dict,\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 {tp1, sl}\n\n    2026-06-03 老公指示：止损改为 ATR 动态 + 2% 保底\n    - 止盈：+4%（TP1 全平 100%）\n    - 止损：max(2%, ATR% × 分层倍数)，防止止损价被行情轻易打穿\n      atr_sl_tiers: <2%ATR→1.0x, <4%→1.5x, ≥4%→2.0x\n\n[2116 more lines in file. Use offset=585 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780658346296}}
