{"type":"message","id":"5c7d6fa5","parentId":"e3caacfd","timestamp":"2026-06-05T11:20:47.020Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"AI hasn't been triggered at all since 15:25 (last LINK signal). That's almost 4 hours ago. The AI only triggers when:\n1. Major news\n2. 24h volatility >15%\n3. Score is within 5 points of threshold (≥55-5 = ≥50)\n4. 2% random chance\n\nNo recent news triggered AI, volatility isn't high enough, and scores (10-30) are way below threshold-5 (50). So AI isn't being called at all.\n\nThe issue is clear: scores are simply too low. AI can't help because it's never triggered when scores are this far below threshold.\n\nLet me present this clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"从 15:25 到现在快 4 小时，AI 一次都没触发。\n\nAI 触发条件：\n- 重大新闻 → 今天没有\n- 24h 波动 >15% → 全盘没到\n- 分数接近阈值（55-5=≥50） → 最高才 30，差太远\n- 2% 随机 → 没踩中\n\nAI 是辅助确认信号用的，不是拉分用的。分数 10-30 离阈值 55 差了一半，AI 连被叫起来的机会都没有。\n\n说白了就是市场太平淡了，没有足够强的方向信号。代码正常，等行情动起来自然会有信号 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":575,"output":433,"cacheRead":78336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79344,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780658438948}}
