{"type":"message","id":"d66c96b9","parentId":"12e196af","timestamp":"2026-06-05T12:57:33.900Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Clean state:\n- 3 positions: DOT SHORT, ETH SHORT, LINK SHORT\n- 6 orders: exactly 2 per position (STOP + TP)\n- All quantities correct (no qty=0)\n- No orphan orders\n- TP/SL are in place with reasonable ratios\n\nThe monitor has been working well over the past ~90 minutes - opened 3 positions automatically with correct TP/SL orders. \n\nLet me also check the latest scores and confirm the monitor is updating trailing stops.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"全干净 👑\n\n```\n持仓 3 | 条件单 6 ✅\n\nDOT  SHORT @0.994  amt=201.0  浮盈+1.99  STOP 1.010 / TP 0.955\nETH  SHORT @1650   amt=0.121  浮亏-0.79  STOP 1683  / TP 1584\nLINK SHORT @7.494  amt=26.67  浮亏-0.86  STOP 7.650 / TP 7.200\n\n浮盈合计: +0.34 USDT\n```\n\n三仓六单，一一对应，数量正确，没有孤儿单。monitor 在你洗澡时候自己开了 3 个仓，止盈止损都跟上了 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":361,"output":380,"cacheRead":83328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84069,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780664247181}}
